# ─── XP LEVEL PROGRESSION ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Total 1,000,000 XP (10 lakh) to reach level 100.
# Smooth power curve (exponent 1.5) with per-level costs snapped to multiples of 500.
# - Level 1: 1,000 XP → user starts with small requirement
# - Per-level costs increase from 1,000 to 15,000 as level goes up
#
# Formula: cumulative[i] = round(1,000,000 * (i/100)^1.5 / 500) * 500
# All per-level costs are clean multiples of 500.

